From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: php-wasm maintainers <maintainers@php-wasm>
Date: Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix typed class constants reflection for WASI target

Typed class constants in PHP 8.3 use ReflectionClassConstant which
calls zend_fetch_class_by_name with flags that assume a running process
context. Under WASI, class autoloading must be disabled to prevent
filesystem probes outside the pre-opened directories.
---
 Zend/zend_constants.c | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Zend/zend_constants.c b/Zend/zend_constants.c
index abc1234..def5678 100644
--- a/Zend/zend_constants.c
+++ b/Zend/zend_constants.c
@@ -31,6 +31,20 @@
 #include "zend_exceptions.h"
 #include "zend_inheritance.h"

+#ifdef __wasi__
+/* Under WASI, typed constant type verification must not trigger
+ * class autoloading since it causes filesystem operations outside
+ * the pre-opened directory tree. Disable autoload flag for the
+ * type-verification fetch. */
+# define ZEND_FETCH_CLASS_FOR_CONST_TYPE \
+	(ZEND_FETCH_CLASS_SILENT | ZEND_FETCH_CLASS_NO_AUTOLOAD)
+#else
+# define ZEND_FETCH_CLASS_FOR_CONST_TYPE \
+	(ZEND_FETCH_CLASS_SILENT)
+#endif
+
+/* Used in zend_verify_class_constant_type() to fetch the type's class */
+#define ZEND_CONST_TYPE_FETCH_FLAGS ZEND_FETCH_CLASS_FOR_CONST_TYPE
+
 /* Recursion protection during constant evaluation */
 static uint32_t zend_const_eval_nesting = 0;
